I don't think this is a problem and don't really think any of
the HI_LORD -> cyan changes are needed. It's not a marker
of the truly dangerous, it's a marker of the top of a race/class.
The symbol of the monster tells you how tough the class is.

A brown O is a lot tougher than a brown G. Brown doesn't mark
"objectively easy", it means "easiest/most common of type" (with
exceptions of course). Similarly for HI_LORD.

